six months;
(e) a copy of National Identity Card or
photocopy of a valid passport;
(f) proof of resident permit for persons
other than Rwandan nationals;
(g) clean Credit Reference Bureau
(CRB) report;
(h) for companies, names and addresses
of shareholders, directors, senior
managers and external auditors;
